            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Crypto: A 'trap door' will open up if bitcoin falls below $80K",
            "description": "<p>While bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) bounces back above $88,000 per token on Tuesday, a lot of damage has already been done in the broader crypto space as the asset's extended sell-off has<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/bitcoin-sell-off-correlation-between-230000472.html\"> dragged crypto stocks and ETFs lower.</a></p>\n<p>Sevens Report Research Founder Tom Essaye and Yahoo Finance senior reporters <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ines-ferre/\">Ines Ferr\u00e9</a> weigh in on the state of the crypto space, coming as Bank of America is recommending that its wealth management clients<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/bank-of-america-says-its-wealth-management-clients-may-put-up-to-4-of-their-portfolio-in-crypto-220028738.html\"> should allocate 4% of their portfolios into crypto.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
